<title>UK: Euromarket turnover fell in week to Nov 28 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover fell in week to Nov 28 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets fell to $919.05 billion in the week to November 28 from $984.35 billion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     44.07		56.42</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     21.38		28.23</p>
<p> Secondary market:		  874.97	     927.94</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    143.47	     195.10</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	675.06	     705.22</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    243.98	     279.14</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
